  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Xeel: Defending Communal Land of the Maya Q`eqchi` in Petn</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin de Comunidades Campesinas Indgenas para el Desarrollo Integral de Petn (ACDIP) will inform residents of 150 communities in the department of Petn of the benefits and risks of current programs to clear title to land and will introduce methods to manage land that are consistent with indigenous practices. It will develop educational materials in Spanish and Q&apos;eqchi&apos;for the residents government officials and international donors.</narrative>
  </description>
